    {
      "firm": "FTMO",
      "kind": "new",
      "text": "Announced 15 Oct 2026: during 26 Oct\u20131 Nov 2026, CFD European equities and specified European indices/commodities shift one hour later in MT4/MT5; original hours return 2 Nov. Applies to affected symbols across CFD Challenge and FTMO Account cohorts; cTrader displays the selected timezone. Max Daily Loss still resets at Prague midnight, with a 2-hour MetaTrader offset that week. Check the official symbol list and Account MetriX countdown.",
      "source": "https://ftmo.com/en/blog/trading-updates/trading-update-15-oct-2026/",
      "modelIds": [
        "ftmo.one",
        "ftmo.two"
      ]
    },
    {
      "firm": "FundedNext",
      "kind": "new",
      "text": "From 12 Oct 2026: Stellar Lite Challenges purchased/reset on or after this date require 2 trading days per evaluation phase; earlier cohorts retain 5. Stellar 2-Step still requires 5 per phase. Lite/1-Step/2-Step FundedNext Accounts have no minimum trading days. The separate 3-Day/On-Demand reward requirements remain unchanged at 5 minimum trading days.",
      "source": "https://help.fundednext.com/en/articles/8019803-what-are-the-minimum-trading-days-in-fundednext-challenges",
      "modelIds": [
        "fundednext.lite"
      ]
    },
    {
      "firm": "GOAT Funded Trader",
      "kind": "new",
      "text": "Effective 6 Oct 2026: all models and purchase cohorts, evaluation and funded, prohibit VPN/VPS/proxy/hosted routing during trading; breach and affected payout ineligibility apply. VPN is permitted for initial login only, disconnected before trading. Clarified 12 Oct: GOAT's dashboard Trade Copier is exempt; other VPS/hosted copiers remain prohibited.",
      "source": "https://help.goatfundedtrader.com/en/articles/17362726-can-i-use-a-vpn-vps-proxy-or-any-other-hosting-service-while-trading"
    },
    {
